# Ink Portal Code Style

- Folder: `Name/Name.tsx`, `Name.types.ts`, `index.ts`; add `Name.const.ts` / `Name.utils.ts` only if needed.
- Types in `*.types.ts`, constants in `*.const.ts`.
- Numbers: `constants/numbers.ts` with `NUMBER_ZERO` … `NUMBER_ONE_HUNDRED`; generals: `EMPTY_STRING`.
- No `useMemo` / `useCallback` unless needed.
- No magic numbers/strings; no inline styling for layout.
- User-facing copy through `useI18n()` / Messages — never hardcode UI sentences.
- Bear components for UI chrome.
- Path aliases: `@/*`, `@const/*`, `@pages/*`, `@components/*`, `@i18n/*`.
- Tag work `portal` in Jira/Linear; library changes live in `ink` with tag `library`.
- Branches from Jira: `{feature|bug}/{PROJECT}-{n}` (e.g. `feature/INK-26`). See `git-jira-branching.mdc`.
- Do not name competitor products in copy.
